				\begin{document}$$ k\left({\boldsymbol{t}}_i,{\boldsymbol{t}}_j\right)\kern0.5em =\kern0.5em {\sigma}_{rbf}^2 \exp \left(-\frac{1}{2}{\displaystyle \sum_k}{w}_k{\left({t}_{ik}-{t}_{jk}\right)}^2\ \right) $$\end{document}ktitj=σrbf2exp−12∑kwktik−tjk2
